    "englishLyrics": "Korrameena ninnu kosukuntaa iyyaala\nPoyyimeena marigindhe masaalaa\nChelikoona vayasaaku isthaareyyaala\nKasimeena tholi vindhuliyyaala\n\nKili kiliye kili kiliye kili killeyo\nKili kiliye kili kiliye kili kiliyo\nKilikiliye kilikiliye kili killeyo\nKili kiliye kili kiliyo\n\nDaavoodi vaadhire vaadhire\nDaavoodi vaadhire vaadhire vaadhi\nDaavoodi vaadhire vaadhire\nDaavoodi vaadhire vaadhire vaadhi\n\nYe vaadhi vaadhi re.. Ye vaadhi vaadhi re..\nDaavoodi vaadhire vaadhire\nDaavoodi vaadhire vaadhire vaadhi\n\nNee etavaalu choope ennela saambraani\nNannekkinchaave pillaa rekkala gurraanni\nAakattukundhi eedu aakali singaanni\nJokottukuntaa ollo cheekati kaalaanni\n\nNalkeesu nadum gingira gingira gingirame\nRangula pongula bongarame\nSannaga nunnaga bhallegā chekkaave\n\nInkendhi edam kassuna bussuna pongadame\nKaamudi chethiki longadame\nHakkuga mokkuga bhallegā dhakkaave\n\nKili kiliye kili kiliye kili killeyo\nKili kiliye kili kiliye kili kiliyo\nKilikiliye kilikiliye kili killeyo\nKili kiliye kili kiliyo\n\nDaavoodi vaadhire vaadhire\nDaavoodi vaadhire vaadhire vaadhi!",
